{x_desk
    {message
        output={@
The mailroom desk is cluttered with envelopes and papers. Pens are strewn
about and various office supplies such as paperclips are thrown over its
surface. But it looks somewhat fake. It's as though it was an attempt
to look like an old timey mailroom.

On a yellowed piece of paper, something catches your eye.

The word 'orb'.

        }
    }
}

{x_on_desk
    {message
        output={@
The top of the mailroom desk is cluttered with envelopes and papers.
Pens are strewn about and various office supplies such as paperclips are
thrown over its surface. But it looks somewhat fake. It's as though it was an
attempt to look like an old timey mailroom.

On a yellowed piece of paper, something catches your eye.

The word 'orb'.
        }
    }
}

{x_under_desk
    {message
        output={@
You look under the desk. There are more piles of papers. Absolute
clutter everywhere.

However you don't see anything suspicious.

        }
    }
}

{x_behind_desk
    {message
        output={@
Behind the desk is a small chair. Even that has papers and envelopes piled
all over it.

        }
    }
}

{x_paper
    {message
        output={@
It is a contract between someone called XLF.
They requested an object - the orb - be built.

"It is the key.

- Retrograde."

        }
    }
}













{input, syntax=[tplt_syntax]((x_desk))
    {act, logic=x_desk, tags=!_type|room }
}

{input, syntax=[tplt_syntax]((x_on_your_desk))
    {act, logic=x_on_desk, tags=!_type|room }
}

{input, syntax=[tplt_syntax]((x_under_desk))
    {act, logic=x_under_desk, tags=!_type|room }
}

{input, syntax=[tplt_syntax]((x_behind_desk))
    {act, logic=x_behind_desk, tags=!_type|room }
}

{input, syntax=[tplt_syntax]((x_paper))
    {act, logic=x_paper, tags=!_type|room }
}
